Description: Modern GTK4 terminal emulator with multi-shell support
 Kiln Terminal is a GTK4 / libadwaita terminal emulator built on VTE. It
 integrates with the GNOME visual style, follows the system dark-mode
 preference, and offers a new-tab split button that lets you pick any
 shell detected on the system (from /etc/shells and common locations)
 for each new tab.

